Agnocast embedded logging ownership patch

Base: d9e28957bfe5b1220e218b0c98511d4174ab09e4
Preserves standalone defaults; embedding runtimes opt out of rcl logging ownership.
Apply from the Agnocast checkout with:
  git apply /workspace/rclpy_zerocopy_ws/patches/agnocast-embedded-logging.patch
